# 9. BANKING TRANSACTIONS

Implement fully functional banking operations.

### Deposit Money

- Select account.
- Enter amount.
- Validate amount.
- Update account balance.
- Generate transaction ID.
- Save transaction details.

### Withdraw Money

- Select account.
- Enter amount.
- Check available balance.
